{"id":"21c089d664e60689","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-jordan-curve.md","title":"Jordan Curve","display":"df-jordan-curve — Jordan Curve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jordan-curve","aliases":["58-df-jordan-curve"],"display":"df-jordan-curve — Jordan Curve","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jordan-curve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jordan-curve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jordan-curve — Jordan Curve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\in V\">\\(\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}\">\\(S^1\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^1}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}\">\\(\\tau_{S^1}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}curve}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S(\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_{S^1}=\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\mathbb R^2).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}curve}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S(\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_{S^1}=\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\mathbb R^2).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two standard topologies are explicitly fixed, so the Jordan property does not depend on hidden topology parameters.</li>\n<li>A Jordan curve is a simple closed plane curve.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]), $\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]), $\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S^1\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2<\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^1}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}curve}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S(\\gamma,\\tau_{S^1},\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2<\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\tau_{S^1}=\\{U\\cap S^1:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\gamma,S^1,\\mathbb R^2).\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1541,"backlinks":[{"id":"b3c8bda61bc135a4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{JordanCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-jordan-curve]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-722","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-jordan-curve.md|58-df-jordan-curve]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["3cd1834de4f2efb2","f5a60b2c6e668b3e"]}